      "en": {
        "name": "Televisorium",
        "summary": "An app to keep track of your watchlist, tv series, movies. Similar to trakt.tv",
        "description": "A Nextcloud app to keep track of your movies, TV shows and watchlist. Similar\nto trakt.tv.\n\nFeatures:\n- Add movies and TV shows to your library from The Movie Database (TMDb)\n- Organize titles into Watchlist, Watching, Watched, On hold and Dropped\n- Browse your library by status or media type (movies, TV shows)\n- Search titles in your library\n- Watch progress tracking per title with auto status updates\n- Episode tracking for TV shows, grouped by season\n- Import all episodes of a season from TMDb\n- Personal ratings per title\n- Per-user metadata language and API key for TMDb\n"
      }
